  "generalInstructions": [
    "All 38 questions are compulsory. There is no overall choice.",
    "The paper carries 80 marks and has a duration of 3 hours.",
    "Section A contains 18 multiple-choice questions and 2 assertion–reason questions of 1 mark each.",
    "Section B contains five very short-answer questions of 2 marks each; internal choice is provided in two questions.",
    "Section C contains six short-answer questions of 3 marks each; internal choice is provided in two questions.",
    "Section D contains four long-answer questions of 5 marks each; internal choice is provided in two questions.",
    "Section E contains three case-study questions of 4 marks each, with subparts carrying 1, 1 and 2 marks. Each 2-mark subpart has an internal choice.",
    "Use π = 22/7 wherever required unless stated otherwise. Calculators are not allowed.",
    "Draw neat and labelled figures wherever required. Show working and state units for mensuration and application problems."
  ],
